<title>POLAND: Agros trades on kerb at PLN 75.</title>
<headline>Agros trades on kerb at PLN 75.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>A kerb transaction in 18,000 shares of Polish food trader Agros Holding SA at 75 zlotys a share was struck on the Warsaw bourse on Tuesday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the regular bourse session Agros rose 1.3 percent to 76 zlotys in a volume of 16,961 shares.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
